==Battleground==
*1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.
*8 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*18 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*8 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Area Attackers like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] can deal with most peons but will struggle to Sleipnir and Kurosawah as they have lower range, [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] can take care of Sleipnir while Kurosawah can be countered by [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]].

==Trivia==
*Along with [[An Hour's Training (Insane)|Shack of Spirit]] and [[A Year's Training (Deadly)|Labyrinth of Spirit]], this stage is a reference to the [[wikia:dragonball:Hyperbolic Time Chamber|Room of Spirit and Time]] from ''Dragon Ball''.

